{"sections":[{"slug":"Artin环","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Artin环"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Artin <span lang=\"zh\">环</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Artin 环”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Artin <span lang=\"zh\">环是满足理想的降链性质的环</span>. (<span lang=\"zh\">这里的环是指交换环</span>.)</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">为域</span>. $k[x]/(x^n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> Artin <span lang=\"zh\">环</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Artin对象","text":"Artin <span lang=\"zh\">对象</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}